        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-74410\"><b>Laurey 74410, Aventura Cabinet Knob in Champagne Brass</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Aventura Champagne Brass Knob has rounded edges, giving it a transitional feel. This Champagne Brass cabinet pull can used on any light weight door or drawer. This kitchen cabinet hardware is easy to care for. The Aventura Cabinet Knob in Champagne Brass comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Aventura\">Laurey Aventura Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 74410 Aventura Champagne Brass Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Champagne Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-74410\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74410-SM.jpg?v=1704354552\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74477\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-74466\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74466-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74466\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-venetian-bronze-knob-laurey-74477\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74477-SM.jpg?v=1704354552\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74477\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-polished-chrome-knob-laurey-74426\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74426-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74426\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-satin-nickel-knob-laurey-74428\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74428-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"115\" height=\"77\" alt=\"LAU-74428\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-74477\"><b>Champagne Brass</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-74466\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-venetian-bronze-knob-laurey-74477\"><b>Venetian Bronze</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-polished-chrome-knob-laurey-74426\"><b>Polished Chrome</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/aventura-satin-nickel-knob-laurey-74428\"><b>Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
